objective: Implement RTP fee per MFIN-2088.

completed_investigation: >
  Ran context-map.sh RTP and context-for.sh calculateFee-rtp. Found two disagreeing
  sources for the RTP rate: config/fee-schedule.yaml (0.35%, USD 2.00 minimum) and
  docs/adr/ADR-0007-fee-schedule.md (0.30% flat, no minimum, Status: Proposed, never
  marked Superseded).

verified_decisions:
  - "Use config/fee-schedule.yaml as authoritative (confirmed by human, see below)"

evidence:
  - "config/fee-schedule.yaml:16-17"
  - "docs/adr/ADR-0007-fee-schedule.md:1,15"
  - "docs/JIRA_TICKETS.md MFIN-2088 Acceptance Criteria"

files_relevant_to_next_step:
  - "src/main/java/com/meridian/payments/PaymentService.java:237-248"

constraints:
  - "Never call LegacyPaymentUtils"
  - "Minimum must compare against the computed fee, not the raw amount"

open_questions:
  - "Should ADR-0007 be formally marked Superseded?"

next_action: "Human decision required (see CONTEXT CONFLICT below), then implement in PaymentService.calculateFee()"

do_not_change:
  - "WIRE, ACH, SWIFT branches of calculateFee"
  - "docs/adr/ADR-0007-fee-schedule.md content (mark Status only, do not rewrite)"

---

