Source A: config/fee-schedule.yaml          — RTP 0.35% + USD 2.00 minimum (committed)
Source B: docs/adr/ADR-0007-fee-schedule.md — RTP 0.30% flat, no minimum (Status: Proposed)

No explicit supersession found.

